abstract: >-
  Stata code reproducing the figures and tables of a study of the Sofala
  Community Carbon Project, a terminated REDD+ and agroforestry project in
  central Mozambique. The analysis combines matched difference-in-differences
  estimates of forest-cover change from Hansen Global Forest Change data with a
  household survey conducted five years after the project ended. The
  analysis-ready data are deposited separately; see README.md.
keywords:
  - REDD+
  - payments for ecosystem services
  - deforestation
  - Mozambique
  - difference-in-differences
  - propensity score matching
  - carbon offsets
  - agroforestry
